--- !u!114 &1576818491
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1576818489}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2c5ee1abd1f1b6e40b9b3592fae328a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcStand
  speaker: Community_Manager
  lines:
  - welcome to v1.1! we listened to all of your feedback.
  - then patch 1.1.2 removed the DOUBLE JUMP. 'confusing for new players'.
  - its REVERT is up in the old tree. the platforms there run on rails...
  - ...and a rail that goes INTO the screen looks like it isn't moving at all. turn the world. watch it.
  - S to talk to me again. not that you will. nobody does.
  goalAfter: ride the rails up the tree
  talkRadius: 2.6
  talkPrompt: {fileID: 1417849115}
